---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Dining Unhinged"
  description="Learn how Dining Unhinged collects, uses, and protects your information."
>

<section class="page-header">
  <div class="container">

    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

    <p class="lead">
      <strong>Last Updated:</strong> July 25, 2026
    </p>

    <p class="lead">
      Your privacy matters. This page explains what information Dining
      Unhinged collects, why it's collected, and how it's used.
    </p>

  </div>
</section>

<section class="policy">

  <article>

    <h2>Information You Share</h2>

    <p>
      If you contact Dining Unhinged through the Contact page or by email,
      you may choose to provide your name, email address, and any information
      included in your message.
    </p>

    <p>
      That information is used only to respond to your inquiry or continue
      our conversation.
    </p>

  </article>

  <article>

    <h2>Website Analytics</h2>

    <p>
      Like most websites, Dining Unhinged may use analytics tools to better
      understand how visitors use the site.
    </p>

    <p>
      This information may include pages visited, time spent on the site,
      approximate location, device type, browser, and other anonymous usage
      statistics. This information helps improve the website, its content,
      and the overall visitor experience.
    </p>

  </article>

  <article>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>

    <p>
      Dining Unhinged may use cookies or similar technologies to improve your
      browsing experience and understand how the website is used.
    </p>

    <p>
      Most web browsers allow you to manage, limit, or disable cookies through
      your browser settings.
    </p>

  </article>

  <article>

    <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>

    <p>
      Dining Unhinged may link to third-party websites or use third-party
      services, including analytics providers and social media platforms.
    </p>

    <p>
      These services operate under their own privacy policies. Dining
      Unhinged is not responsible for how those third parties collect,
      store, or use your information.
    </p>

  </article>

  <article>

    <h2>Email</h2>

    <p>
      If you contact Dining Unhinged by email, your message and contact
      information will only be used to respond to your inquiry unless you
      request otherwise.
    </p>

    <p>
      Your information is never sold or shared for marketing purposes.
    </p>

  </article>

  <article>

    <h2>Your Information</h2>

    <p>
      Dining Unhinged does not sell your personal information.
    </p>

    <p>
      Dining Unhinged is committed to handling personal information in
      accordance with applicable Canadian privacy laws.
    </p>

    <p>
      If you would like your email or previous correspondence removed from
      our records, simply get in touch and your request will be honoured
      wherever reasonably possible.
    </p>

  </article>

  <article>

    <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>

    <p>
      As Dining Unhinged grows, this Privacy Policy may be updated to reflect
      new features, services, or legal requirements.
    </p>

    <p>
      The most current version will always be published on this page.
    </p>

  </article>

  <article>

    <h2>Questions?</h2>

    <p>If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please visit the <a href="/contact"><strong>Contact</strong></a> page or email <a href="mailto:diningunhinged@gmail.com"><strong>diningunhinged@gmail.com</strong></a>.</p>

  </article>

</section>

</MainLayout>